OL,3,GNEWSAChris Mason: Burnham and Swinney
OL,4,Atussle over where power lies in
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FUK political debate has had a
OL,8,Fdistinctly Scottish feel these last few
OL,9,Fdays.
OL,11,FAs the Scottish National Party has
OL,12,Fgathered for its annual conference at
OL,13,Fthe Event Complex on the outskirts of
OL,14,FAberdeen, the Conservative leader Kemi
OL,15,FBadenoch has been in Paisley and
OL,16,FEdinburgh and the prime minister has
OL,17,Fbeen in Motherwell.
