OL,3,GNEWSAChris Mason: Burnham and Swinney
OL,4,Atussle over where power lies in
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe SNP is buoyant, its activists
OL,8,Fgathering for the first time since it
OL,9,Fwon, in May, a fifth consecutive
OL,10,FScottish Parliament election, albeit
OL,11,Fwith fewer seats than they won in 2021.
OL,13,FNext year will mark the moment the
OL,14,Fparty has been in devolved power at
OL,15,FHolyrood for 20 years.
